WEBVTT

00:03.600 --> 00:06.350
You? Working?

00:06.350 --> 00:09.310
Yeah. Jun's birthday's coming up, you know?

00:09.780 --> 00:13.960
I want to give him a present, 
but I don't have any money.

00:13.960 --> 00:18.210
Do you know what kinds of jobs high 
school kids are allowed to do?

00:18.210 --> 00:20.800
O-Of course I do!

00:20.800 --> 00:23.960
The ones where you say, like, 
"Welcome!" and stuff...

00:24.650 --> 00:26.540
They call it the service industry, right?

00:26.750 --> 00:31.120
Even if you don't like how your boss or 
the customers look, you can't punch them.

00:31.120 --> 00:33.360
How about I punch <i>you</i> first?

00:35.070 --> 00:36.390
I guess I have no choice.

00:36.800 --> 00:37.550
Huh?

00:37.760 --> 00:40.930
The idea of sending you off 
to work alone worries me,

00:40.930 --> 00:42.640
so I'll work with you.

00:42.640 --> 00:43.980
Really?!

00:43.980 --> 00:46.820
Thanks! That makes me feel a lot better!

00:46.820 --> 00:48.400
Let me in on it, too.

00:49.370 --> 00:51.720
Oh, you wanna work part-time, too?

00:51.720 --> 00:53.690
I do!

00:53.690 --> 00:56.150
Wait, what? You wanna work part-time?

00:56.150 --> 00:58.190
Then why don't all of you...

00:59.500 --> 01:01.490
work at my place?

01:12.670 --> 01:17.970
<i>When I throw a jab or a straight,
 it always lands</i>

01:17.970 --> 01:23.100
<i>But when I'm aiming for your heart,
 I miss every time</i>

01:23.100 --> 01:28.440
<i>Parallel, zigzagging, awkward, incoherent</i>

01:28.440 --> 01:32.940
<i>When you look my way and move closer to me</i>

01:32.940 --> 01:38.700
<i>I know it doesn't mean the same thing for you</i>

01:38.700 --> 01:43.740
<i>But I wish we could stay like this forever</i>

01:43.740 --> 01:49.880
<i>My changing feelings are driving me crazy</i>

01:49.880 --> 01:55.170
<i>The moment you turn to face me,
 take that! Telepathy</i>

01:55.170 --> 02:00.640
<i>If only we could feel the same thing</i>

02:00.640 --> 02:05.520
<i>I want to kick this pesky subtlety away</i>

02:05.520 --> 02:11.520
<i>I want to know everything, 
I want to know everything</i>

02:11.520 --> 02:14.070
<i>I can't fool you forever</i>

02:14.070 --> 02:16.690
<i>I can't keep this hidden</i>

02:16.690 --> 02:21.450
<i>I want to shout out my secret, AHHH</i>

02:23.370 --> 02:25.910
<i>Take that! Telepathy</i>

02:25.910 --> 02:28.370
<i>Te-te-te-telepathy</i>

02:29.080 --> 02:31.460
<i>Telepathy</i>

02:33.250 --> 02:37.010
<b>My First Part-Time Job</b>

02:33.670 --> 02:35.550
"My First Part-Time Job."

02:37.010 --> 02:40.430
<b>God Ramen Tatsumi</b>

02:37.010 --> 02:40.430
Welcome, welcome! This is 
my family's restaurant!

02:40.430 --> 02:42.470
Tatsumi's told me about you three.

02:40.430 --> 02:44.890
<b>God Ramen Tatsumi</b>

02:42.470 --> 02:44.890
I'm his dad, Tatsuro.

02:44.890 --> 02:46.720
Glad to have you on board.

02:46.720 --> 02:48.230
H-Hello!

02:48.230 --> 02:49.600
Thank you for letting us work here.

02:49.600 --> 02:50.560
Thanks!

02:50.560 --> 02:53.730
Boy, you have no idea how much 
I appreciate you doing this.

02:53.730 --> 02:57.480
My wife and I were running 
this restaurant on our own,

02:58.150 --> 03:01.450
but just recently, she...

03:02.740 --> 03:05.330
went home to visit her family!

03:05.580 --> 03:09.710
Come back to me, Kiyomi!

03:09.710 --> 03:12.750
Don't mind him. This happens all the time.

03:15.540 --> 03:16.590
Hey...

03:17.340 --> 03:19.840
Do I really have to work in this?

03:19.840 --> 03:22.050
Yay! It's cute!

03:22.050 --> 03:26.180
I'm so glad I got those in case 
we ever got any female help!

03:26.180 --> 03:27.770
This was your idea?!

03:27.770 --> 03:30.430
These don't look much like 
ramen shop uniforms!

03:30.430 --> 03:33.400
In that case, I'm okay with not 
being a ramen shop anymore.

03:33.400 --> 03:34.610
Come on, boss!

03:34.610 --> 03:37.360
That's the uniform. 
What other choice is there?

03:35.610 --> 03:37.440
<b>God Ramen Tatsumi</b>

03:37.360 --> 03:38.820
Just shut up and wear it.

03:38.820 --> 03:41.780
So why aren't <i>you</i> wearing it?!

03:43.240 --> 03:44.700
<b>God Ramen Tatsumi</b>

03:44.700 --> 03:46.580
Okay, we're open!

03:46.950 --> 03:49.750
We got a customer! Welcome!

03:50.290 --> 03:53.290
Uh... Wel...co...

03:53.670 --> 03:55.210
Welcome.

03:55.210 --> 03:57.840
Will this seat at the counter be all right?

03:57.840 --> 03:59.130
Uh, sure.

04:00.960 --> 04:03.260
Hi there. Whatcha wanna eat?

04:03.260 --> 04:05.390
Huh? Uh...

04:05.760 --> 04:07.810
What would you recommend?

04:07.810 --> 04:08.810
Recommend?

04:09.060 --> 04:11.850
Yeah. What do you think tastes the best?

04:11.850 --> 04:15.560
Oh! Well, I like cake.

04:15.560 --> 04:17.400
Huh? You have that here?

04:18.070 --> 04:19.230
I'm afraid not.

04:20.190 --> 04:22.860
<b>God Ramen Tatsumi
5 Toppings FREE</b>

04:20.440 --> 04:22.900
You're clearly useless at 
dealing with customers,

04:22.860 --> 04:26.240
<b>God Ramen Tatsumi
5 Toppings FREE</b>

04:23.150 --> 04:25.030
so at least be a panda.

04:25.030 --> 04:26.240
Okay.

04:26.450 --> 04:28.160
Hey, Tomo-chan...

04:28.740 --> 04:31.200
What noise do pandas make?

04:31.200 --> 04:35.580
Huh? They're like bears, 
so... I guess they roar?

04:39.040 --> 04:42.380
Roar!

04:44.340 --> 04:45.970
Thank you for your patronage.

04:45.970 --> 04:47.180
Come again!

04:47.430 --> 04:49.640
When we're working side by side like this,

04:49.640 --> 04:52.640
it almost feels like you 
married into my family!

04:52.890 --> 04:56.900
I'm sorry. I didn't quite catch that.
 Could you say it again?

04:56.900 --> 05:00.610
I said it feels like you 
married into my family.

05:00.610 --> 05:01.860
One more time.

05:02.440 --> 05:04.360
It... It feels like you...

05:04.360 --> 05:05.780
Can you still say that?

05:06.360 --> 05:08.450
S-Sorry.

05:13.660 --> 05:15.750
Miso ramen with a side of gyoza, please.

05:15.750 --> 05:17.620
You got it!

05:18.210 --> 05:18.830
Welco—

05:20.880 --> 05:21.920
Tomo?!

05:25.420 --> 05:27.760
Hey, Kubojun! Good to see you again!

05:27.760 --> 05:30.300
Hey, Tanabe... What's going on here?

05:30.300 --> 05:32.390
There was one outside, too.

05:32.390 --> 05:34.220
Well, actually...

05:34.220 --> 05:35.560
Welcome.

05:36.390 --> 05:38.400
Allow me to show you to your seat.

05:38.900 --> 05:41.400
You're... Gundo, right?

05:41.400 --> 05:44.440
You would forget the face 
of a childhood friend?

05:44.440 --> 05:47.570
Forgive my rudeness, sir, 
but are you a chicken or something?

05:47.820 --> 05:50.200
Right this way. Your seat is over here.

05:50.200 --> 05:52.030
Yep, that's Gundo.

05:52.870 --> 05:56.000
Hey, Tanabe! What did you mean by "again"?

05:56.000 --> 05:57.790
Does he come here that often?!

05:57.790 --> 06:00.420
Y-Yeah, once a week or so.

06:00.420 --> 06:04.050
Why didn't you tell me sooner?!
 I'll throttle you!

06:04.050 --> 06:05.760
Uh, sorry...

06:05.760 --> 06:09.720
Well? What do you think of 
Tomo in her waitress uniform?

06:10.180 --> 06:14.470
I was surprised, but... 
I mean... I guess it's nice.

06:14.850 --> 06:18.560
"I guess it's nice"? 
What do you think that means?

06:18.560 --> 06:20.440
I think that means it's fine.

06:20.940 --> 06:22.940
Here's your char siu ramen.

06:23.440 --> 06:24.440
Thanks...

06:24.980 --> 06:26.990
Go on and laugh if you want.

06:26.990 --> 06:27.860
Huh?

06:28.070 --> 06:31.820
I mean, I look ridiculous in this, don't I?

06:32.240 --> 06:36.660
No, I... don't think it looks bad at all.

06:38.000 --> 06:41.630
"Not bad"? What do you think that means?

06:41.630 --> 06:43.590
I think that means it's fine.

06:44.420 --> 06:45.800
Great meal.

06:45.800 --> 06:49.260
Th-Thank you very much. Please come again.

06:49.880 --> 06:52.180
This feels kinda weird, huh?

06:52.180 --> 06:54.350
How long are you gonna keep working here?

06:54.350 --> 06:57.220
Huh? Just until the end of the long weekend.

06:57.220 --> 07:00.350
Okay, I'll come back tomorrow, 
then. Keep it up.

07:07.820 --> 07:09.950
I brought some customers.

07:11.240 --> 07:12.910
Thank you for waiting.

07:12.910 --> 07:14.200
No problem!

07:21.790 --> 07:25.040
<b>God Ramen Tatsumi</b>

07:22.370 --> 07:25.040
<b>3 Days Later</b>

07:25.040 --> 07:26.920
Great work, all of you.

07:26.920 --> 07:29.260
These have been a fun few days.

07:29.800 --> 07:31.680
And here's your pay.

07:32.220 --> 07:35.140
Boss... Thanks for everything!

07:35.430 --> 07:37.310
Yay! Money!

07:37.310 --> 07:39.980
Isn't this more than you promised us?

07:39.980 --> 07:43.310
Since you all worked so hard,
 I added a bit extra.

07:43.310 --> 07:45.900
I think that was to be expected, 
given that we produced results.

07:45.900 --> 07:47.520
R-Right...

07:48.030 --> 07:49.900
<i>Did she squeeze it out of him?</i>

07:49.900 --> 07:52.860
Will the shop be okay without us?

07:52.860 --> 07:57.200
Don't worry! It's about time for Mom to 
make her periodic trip back here, anyway.

07:57.370 --> 08:01.000
If I'm being honest, I'd love to 
have you keep working here...

08:01.250 --> 08:04.080
We'd be glad to come back and 
help you out occasionally.

08:04.080 --> 08:05.670
What? Really?!

08:05.920 --> 08:09.380
There aren't many employers that 
give workers so much freedom.

08:09.380 --> 08:11.880
I wanna come back again, too!

08:12.260 --> 08:15.140
<i>I feel like I'm making a 
deal with the devil.</i>

08:18.600 --> 08:19.600
Jun?

08:21.230 --> 08:22.180
Hey.

08:22.180 --> 08:24.560
You waited to meet me 
after work again today?

08:24.940 --> 08:27.060
Well, Tomo, see you at school.

08:27.060 --> 08:27.650
Yep!

08:28.020 --> 08:30.570
I'll walk home with Misuzu-chan.

08:30.570 --> 08:31.360
Not so close.

08:33.030 --> 08:37.280
You actually came to the restaurant 
every day of our break.

08:37.570 --> 08:38.700
You that bored?

08:39.450 --> 08:41.250
I went because you were there.

08:44.040 --> 08:46.500
I figured if you went on some wild rampage,

08:46.500 --> 08:49.210
they'd need someone around 
who could stop you.

08:49.210 --> 08:51.760
Huh?! What do you think I am, exactly?!

08:51.760 --> 08:52.720
Besides...

08:53.300 --> 08:55.720
I've eaten their ramen tons of times,

08:56.220 --> 09:00.680
but for some reason, it seemed to taste 
better when you brought it to me.

09:01.770 --> 09:03.520
So... you know...

09:04.020 --> 09:05.140
Good job.

09:05.600 --> 09:07.650
Th-Thanks.

09:14.740 --> 09:16.950
I can really have this?!

09:16.950 --> 09:19.490
Yep. It's your birthday present.

09:19.490 --> 09:21.290
It's just a cheap one, though.

09:21.290 --> 09:23.620
That's totally fine! It's great!

09:23.830 --> 09:27.170
Incidentally, I wear the same one.

09:27.170 --> 09:28.710
That doesn't bother you, does it?

09:28.710 --> 09:30.630
Of course it doesn't bother me!

09:30.630 --> 09:32.960
As long as it's you, I wouldn't 
mind matching from head to toe!

09:32.960 --> 09:34.670
H-Head to toe?!

09:34.670 --> 09:37.380
I mean, that'd be cool, right?
 Like we're a team!

09:37.380 --> 09:40.350
Oh... Right, a team.

09:41.260 --> 09:43.890
<i>It hasn't been like this in so long.</i>

09:43.890 --> 09:47.850
<i>I thought he'd changed recently, 
but I guess Jun is still Jun.</i>

09:48.270 --> 09:49.770
I bought cake, too.

09:49.770 --> 09:52.400
Wanna have a birthday party at your place?

09:53.610 --> 09:57.660
My mom's... gonna be home late tonight.

09:57.660 --> 09:59.700
Huh? Oh...

09:59.700 --> 10:03.160
S-So if we're having a party, 
can it be at your place?

10:03.160 --> 10:05.120
I'm sure Akemi-san will be there.

10:05.120 --> 10:07.620
Y-Yeah, that makes sense.

10:08.500 --> 10:10.920
<i>Maybe something really is different!</i>

10:13.050 --> 10:17.010
<b>The Abandoned Cinderella</b>

10:13.800 --> 10:15.920
"The Abandoned Cinderella."

10:18.260 --> 10:19.550
Misuzu...

10:20.390 --> 10:24.100
What can I do to make Jun see me as a girl?

10:24.100 --> 10:26.060
Haven't heard that in a while.

10:26.060 --> 10:29.230
Things have been going 
great lately, thanks to you!

10:29.230 --> 10:30.940
I figure if I'm gonna push, now's the time!

10:30.940 --> 10:32.770
Got any ideas that'll work quick?

10:33.070 --> 10:34.730
Let him touch your chest?

10:34.730 --> 10:35.480
Huh?

10:35.820 --> 10:38.070
Wh-What the hell are you saying?!

10:38.070 --> 10:39.950
The chest would be too much,

10:39.950 --> 10:43.200
but sharing bodily contact is the 
quickest way to move forward.

10:43.200 --> 10:46.540
Sharing contact? But it's 
not that easy to just...

10:46.830 --> 10:49.830
Don't worry. I have a plan.

10:50.080 --> 10:51.170
You do?

10:51.170 --> 10:55.170
Yes. All you have to do is stand facing him.

10:55.670 --> 10:57.260
Then I'll...

10:57.510 --> 11:00.050
push him into you from behind.

11:00.050 --> 11:01.720
What's with you today?

11:02.260 --> 11:05.680
A regular push probably won't 
be enough to even budge him,

11:05.680 --> 11:07.310
so I'll push him down from here.

11:07.310 --> 11:08.730
That's dangerous!

11:09.020 --> 11:11.770
It's fine as long as you catch him.

11:11.770 --> 11:14.060
That's not the issue here!

11:14.060 --> 11:15.650
Ah, I get it.

11:15.940 --> 11:19.030
You don't feel confident 
that you could catch him.

11:19.280 --> 11:20.110
Huh?

11:22.360 --> 11:24.030
Who do you think I am?

11:24.030 --> 11:27.330
I can catch a Jun or two, no problem!

11:27.330 --> 11:31.040
<i>Perfect. I changed the subject to muscles.</i>

11:31.960 --> 11:34.040
What're you doing here?

11:34.590 --> 11:38.050
Hey, Tomo. What are you doing down there?

11:38.420 --> 11:40.090
I'm ready anytime.

11:40.090 --> 11:41.880
Bring it on!

11:42.260 --> 11:45.350
Huh? Bring what on? What are you—

11:46.310 --> 11:47.600
<i>Is this girl...</i>

11:47.930 --> 11:50.390
<i>trying to flat-out kill me now?!</i>

11:50.600 --> 11:54.770
<i>Now, go. And put on a pathetic 
display of confusion.</i>

11:54.770 --> 11:56.650
<i>Just like before.</i>

11:57.110 --> 11:58.730
Hell yeah!

11:58.730 --> 12:00.990
Bring it!

12:03.780 --> 12:05.450
<i>Huh?! He dodged me?!</i>

12:05.820 --> 12:08.200
Oh, it's Jun-kun.

12:14.710 --> 12:18.130
Ooh. Bad Jun-kun.

12:19.000 --> 12:21.550
Sorry! It wasn't on purpose!

12:21.550 --> 12:25.090
Let me make it up to you! 
If there's anything I can do, name it!

12:25.090 --> 12:27.600
Aw, that's okay, really.

12:27.600 --> 12:31.060
It is <i>not</i> okay! Treat yourself better!
 In various ways!

12:32.020 --> 12:33.100
Then...

12:35.480 --> 12:38.190
Tomo, do it! Don't hold back!

12:38.190 --> 12:41.240
Are you sure? None of this was your fault.

12:41.530 --> 12:43.200
I'm sure! Do it!

12:44.860 --> 12:45.660
More!

12:46.450 --> 12:47.620
More!

12:51.040 --> 12:55.080
<i>What I did today was way 
over the line, even for me.</i>

12:56.540 --> 12:58.750
<i>What in the world am I...</i>

13:01.380 --> 13:02.670
Misuzu-cha—

13:03.130 --> 13:05.430
<i>Is this divine retribution?</i>

13:08.850 --> 13:10.220
Ow...

13:10.220 --> 13:12.310
You okay, Misuzu-chan?

13:12.560 --> 13:16.100
<i>Must be my lucky day, to have 
Misuzu-chan fall on me...</i>

13:16.440 --> 13:19.610
I'm sorry, Tanabe-kun. 
You're not hurt, are you?

13:19.940 --> 13:20.570
Huh?

13:20.570 --> 13:22.650
Wh-Wh-What's wrong with you, Misuzu-chan?!

13:22.650 --> 13:25.780
Not only did you apologize, 
but you're showing concern for me?!

13:25.780 --> 13:27.950
Oh, no! Did you hit your head?!

13:27.950 --> 13:29.120
I'm fine.

13:29.740 --> 13:33.250
You saved me by cushioning my fall.

13:33.250 --> 13:35.620
Should I do something to thank you?

13:35.620 --> 13:36.960
That's not necessary!

13:36.960 --> 13:38.920
You don't need to hold back.

13:39.380 --> 13:42.920
Right now... I just feel 
a pressing need to atone.

13:43.550 --> 13:45.470
<i>I don't quite get it, but...</i>

13:45.470 --> 13:47.970
<i>A chance like this doesn't come every day!</i>

13:47.970 --> 13:50.050
<i>What should I ask her to do, though?</i>

13:50.050 --> 13:53.930
<i>How far can I go? Should I just 
push as far as I dare? Or...</i>

13:53.930 --> 13:55.060
<i>Oh, crap!</i>

13:55.060 --> 13:58.230
<i>I thought about it too long! 
She's almost back to her usual self!</i>

13:58.520 --> 14:03.980
I-I'd really like to... swap contact info!

14:03.980 --> 14:07.490
Okay, then. I got off a lot 
easier than I expected.

14:07.490 --> 14:10.120
<i>Damn it! I could've gotten more?!</i>

14:11.120 --> 14:12.790
Hey, Misuzu-chan.

14:12.950 --> 14:15.620
What was that all about earlier?

14:15.620 --> 14:17.250
I finally realized something.

14:17.500 --> 14:21.590
It seems I don't want Tomo and 
Junichiro to get together.

14:21.590 --> 14:22.380
Huh?

14:23.300 --> 14:27.550
All this time, all I've 
done is get in their way.

14:27.550 --> 14:29.840
Are you sure about that?

14:30.140 --> 14:34.180
I don't think you're as 
bad as you think you are.

14:34.180 --> 14:35.310
Carol...

14:35.310 --> 14:36.600
Misuzu-chan...

14:37.640 --> 14:38.690
Get off me.

14:38.690 --> 14:41.440
Even now, I still can't get away with it?

14:47.280 --> 14:49.990
Misuzu's pretty late.

14:49.990 --> 14:51.280
Did she oversleep?

14:51.280 --> 14:53.910
She said she was staying home sick today.

14:54.620 --> 14:56.950
I didn't know about that.

14:56.950 --> 14:58.710
How did you find out?

14:58.710 --> 15:01.170
I got a message from her.

15:01.170 --> 15:03.130
Why'd she only tell you?

15:04.380 --> 15:06.510
Don't get all smug!

15:08.090 --> 15:10.050
We'll start homeroom now.

15:10.880 --> 15:15.560
Today, we'll assign parts for our production 
of <i>Cinderella</i> at the cultural festival.

15:12.300 --> 15:16.140
<b>Cultural Festival 
"Cinderella" 

• Cinderella 
• Prince 
• Stepmother 
• Stepsister 1 
• Stepsister 2 
• Fairy Godmother</b>

15:17.180 --> 15:19.690
Who should play the part of Cinderella?

15:20.060 --> 15:23.560
<b>3 Days Later</b>

15:24.360 --> 15:27.320
<i>I've never taken this many days off before.</i>

15:27.320 --> 15:29.900
<i>I just can't bring myself to face Tomo.</i>

15:39.410 --> 15:41.830
There are many things I want to say,

15:42.670 --> 15:44.710
but first, why did you come to the window?

15:44.710 --> 15:48.510
I would've felt bad making you 
go downstairs when you're sick.

15:48.510 --> 15:50.340
That's a favor I never asked for.

15:50.340 --> 15:51.930
C'mon, don't play tough.

15:51.930 --> 15:54.720
I bought all kinds of sweet 
stuff for ya! Want 'em?

15:54.720 --> 15:56.060
I do not.

15:56.060 --> 15:58.680
I've got those things that 
cool your forehead down, too!

15:58.680 --> 15:59.890
No, thanks.

16:00.560 --> 16:01.810
Okay.

16:01.810 --> 16:04.690
What is all this? 
You're not acting like yourself.

16:04.940 --> 16:08.690
Well, lately it seems like <i>she's</i> the 
only one you wanna be friends with.

16:09.900 --> 16:13.070
It's great that you're getting 
along so well with Carol...

16:13.780 --> 16:16.870
but you've been avoiding me, haven't you?

16:20.620 --> 16:23.460
I think my cold just came back.
 I'm going to sleep.

16:23.460 --> 16:25.330
Hey! No fair!

16:25.630 --> 16:26.840
Jeez...

16:27.090 --> 16:31.590
<b>"Cinderella"</b>

16:27.590 --> 16:30.840
Here. It's the script for 
our cultural festival play.

16:30.840 --> 16:31.590
Read up.

16:34.050 --> 16:37.430
If you don't like me anymore, 
I can't help that.

16:37.760 --> 16:40.560
But if that's not the case,

16:40.560 --> 16:42.810
you're probably just overthinking things.

16:46.480 --> 16:51.150
<i>Overthinking... Yeah, maybe to her.</i>

16:51.820 --> 16:54.740
<i>No matter how horrible 
I made myself out to be,</i>

16:54.740 --> 16:58.740
<i>I'm sure she'd just smile and 
forgive me like it was nothing.</i>

16:59.410 --> 17:02.160
<i>But that's exactly why I...</i>

17:07.000 --> 17:10.300
What the hell is this about 
me being Cinderella?!

17:10.300 --> 17:12.380
C-Calm down, Misuzu!

17:12.380 --> 17:15.220
I'm a girl, and they're 
making me play the prince!

17:15.220 --> 17:17.590
The whole class decided together.

17:17.590 --> 17:19.600
Who gave my name first?!

17:20.010 --> 17:20.760
Oh...

17:21.310 --> 17:22.350
I know!

17:22.350 --> 17:25.020
Misuzu-chan should be Cinderella!

17:25.020 --> 17:26.730
That was me.

17:27.690 --> 17:30.270
You're gonna rip her cheeks off!

17:30.270 --> 17:31.190
Hey.

17:31.190 --> 17:34.030
So you finally showed up, Cinderella.

17:34.150 --> 17:35.240
What?

17:36.070 --> 17:39.160
You think you're in any 
place to make fun of me?!

17:39.160 --> 17:40.490
You're playing a tree!

17:40.490 --> 17:42.950
Yeah, yeah! You're a tree!

17:42.950 --> 17:46.000
Quit making things even more 
complicated when you're a tree!

17:46.000 --> 17:52.250
<b>Cinderella 
Act 1 
"Cinderella's House"</b>

17:47.250 --> 17:49.630
We'll begin the play practice now.

17:49.630 --> 17:51.920
Everyone with a part, come up front.

17:52.250 --> 17:55.630
<b>"Cinderella" 
Act 1 
"Cinderella's House"</b>

17:52.250 --> 17:55.630
Cinderella, hurry up and prepare our dinner!

17:55.630 --> 17:59.850
Hey, Cinderella! You'd better have 
finished the laundry I told you to do!

17:59.850 --> 18:03.810
Cinderella, have you 
finished cleaning my room?

18:03.810 --> 18:06.270
Clean your own damn room.

18:06.270 --> 18:08.020
Sh-She's scary!

18:08.020 --> 18:09.440
Mother!

18:09.440 --> 18:11.400
Don't worry. It's all right.

18:11.400 --> 18:14.150
Hey, calm down! It's just play practice!

18:14.150 --> 18:16.360
Why is <i>she</i> playing the stepmother?

18:16.820 --> 18:18.740
I can't concentrate in here.

18:18.740 --> 18:20.370
Let's practice our lines somewhere else.

18:20.370 --> 18:22.080
Uh, sure.

18:23.200 --> 18:25.700
Greetings, my prince.

18:25.700 --> 18:28.790
Wh-What a beautiful l-lady you are!

18:28.790 --> 18:31.090
W-Would you d-dance with—

18:31.090 --> 18:33.050
Literally no one is <i>this</i> awkward.

18:33.050 --> 18:36.010
Well, I mean, I've never acted before!

18:36.010 --> 18:37.340
How do I even do it?

18:37.630 --> 18:41.180
In your case, you could probably 
just talk the way you normally do.

18:41.350 --> 18:43.560
What a beautiful lady you are.

18:44.140 --> 18:46.270
Would you dance with me?

18:48.230 --> 18:51.150
See? That's no good at all!

18:51.150 --> 18:53.730
It's perfect, you lady-killer.

18:54.650 --> 18:59.200
You're so lucky. You and 
Carol make great princesses.

18:59.200 --> 19:02.910
Hardly. This isn't my kind of thing, either.

19:02.910 --> 19:06.040
I wouldn't say I wish I could 
be a princess or anything,

19:06.250 --> 19:11.080
but if I'm the type to play a prince, 
no one's ever gonna see me as a girl.

19:12.040 --> 19:16.460
I don't see why there couldn't 
be princesses like you.

19:16.460 --> 19:17.260
Huh?

19:17.260 --> 19:21.260
Having you play Cinderella might 
be a bit too much to ask, but...

19:21.260 --> 19:24.260
You could be a bandit princess.

19:24.260 --> 19:26.180
How about I rob <i>you</i> blind?

19:26.770 --> 19:29.180
Well, we should be heading back.

19:29.180 --> 19:30.020
Right.

19:30.640 --> 19:34.440
<i>Tomo says she wants to 
go out with Junichiro,</i>

19:34.440 --> 19:37.940
<i>but she's convinced herself that 
she's not worthy of that right now.</i>

19:38.990 --> 19:40.700
<i>And it's all because...</i>

19:41.200 --> 19:43.660
Then why not act more like a girl?

19:44.370 --> 19:47.080
<i>I put that curse on Tomo.</i>

19:47.450 --> 19:49.500
<i>Now I have to undo it.</i>

19:49.500 --> 19:52.250
<i>There's no one else who can.</i>

19:59.050 --> 20:02.050
Tomo-chan, you look so handsome!

20:02.050 --> 20:05.010
Really? This is kinda embarrassing...

20:09.310 --> 20:11.350
Th-The binder busted loose!

20:11.350 --> 20:13.190
We need to wrap her tighter!

20:17.150 --> 20:19.400
Wow...

20:19.400 --> 20:20.860
She's a princess...

20:21.240 --> 20:23.360
Aizawa-san, you've got a knack for this!

20:23.360 --> 20:24.820
R-Really?

20:24.820 --> 20:27.280
That dress looks great on you, Olston-san.

20:27.280 --> 20:28.620
Thanks!

20:28.620 --> 20:31.040
Hey, can I call you "Carol-chan"?

20:31.040 --> 20:32.160
Sure!

20:32.160 --> 20:34.080
Oh! Then I will, too!

20:35.170 --> 20:37.500
<i>Everyone else is moving forward,</i>

20:38.210 --> 20:39.420
<i>yet only I'm still...</i>

20:40.010 --> 20:41.550
Something bothering you?

20:42.090 --> 20:45.680
Since it's you, I'm guessing it's about Tomo?

20:45.680 --> 20:47.180
Mind your own business.

20:47.850 --> 20:50.980
I bet you're only thinking of roundabout 
ways to deal with it, right?

20:50.980 --> 20:54.230
Why don't you try facing 
her head-on for once?

20:56.690 --> 20:58.770
Damn it! I can't get up!

20:59.190 --> 21:01.610
You're the last person 
I want to hear that from.

21:03.110 --> 21:07.620
All the prep's on track. Now we just 
wait for the festival to start.

21:08.120 --> 21:10.580
You're so laid-back about this.

21:10.580 --> 21:12.870
I've got nothing but stress.

21:13.080 --> 21:15.870
If you've got nothing to do, 
help me practice my lines.

21:15.870 --> 21:19.840
No way. Cinderella's basically 
the only character you talk to.

21:21.010 --> 21:23.220
<i>Jun as... Cinderella?</i>

21:25.630 --> 21:27.640
Wh-What's wrong with that?

21:27.970 --> 21:30.060
Just do it! It doesn't bother me!

21:30.510 --> 21:33.180
Yeah, it might not bother <i>you</i>, but...

21:33.990 --> 21:36.240
Wait! Please, wait!

21:36.240 --> 21:38.810
I want to know more about you!

21:38.810 --> 21:42.430
I-I'm very sorry, Your Highness.

21:42.430 --> 21:45.830
I have to g-g-go now.

21:46.190 --> 21:48.010
F-Farewell.

21:48.010 --> 21:49.330
Please don't go!

21:50.020 --> 21:52.710
Look, can we please stop now?

21:53.090 --> 21:55.680
<i>This is kinda fun!</i>

21:55.680 --> 21:57.700
Help me out a little more!

21:57.700 --> 21:58.580
Huh?!

21:58.580 --> 22:01.370
Please don't go, Cinderella!

22:01.370 --> 22:03.510
I-I can't stay!

22:03.510 --> 22:09.130
Please remove your hand, Your Highness!

22:10.890 --> 22:14.640
<i>(This suspicious behavior is...)</i>

22:14.640 --> 22:18.940
<i>Hey, you know, I'm all mixed up</i>

22:18.940 --> 22:23.400
<i>It's too complicated, I'm freaking out</i>

22:23.400 --> 22:25.940
<i>I want to look cute to you</i>

22:23.730 --> 22:29.280
<i>(crazy, crazy, drive me crazy, and that's…)</i>

22:25.940 --> 22:28.570
<i>So I'm plotting, bargaining, 
sly, and stubborn</i>

22:29.280 --> 22:33.080
<i>Dizzying love</i>

22:34.240 --> 22:38.670
<i>Just tell him to look at you</i>

22:38.670 --> 22:43.630
<i>And watch him stiffen up even more, 
because you're both so awkward</i>

22:43.630 --> 22:47.510
<i>What? Even if we're alike in that way</i>

22:47.510 --> 22:52.100
<i>It doesn't make me happy, 'cause it
 means our love is going nowhere</i>

22:52.100 --> 23:00.980
<i>Cloudy heart, swirling emotions—
I sense rain coming</i>

23:00.980 --> 23:10.070
<i>So I partly open my umbrella, 
then sneakily scoot closer to you</i>

23:10.070 --> 23:14.030
<i>Please notice the curl of my 
eyelashes as I keep blinking</i>

23:14.030 --> 23:18.960
<i>And don't say I'm acting weird</i>

23:18.960 --> 23:22.920
<i>All this plotting and bargaining 
is my sly plan to look cute to you</i>

23:22.920 --> 23:27.970
<i>Try to solve the riddle of 
this soft, dizzying love</i>

23:25.840 --> 23:30.090
<i>(Buzzing, fidgeting)</i>

23:30.340 --> 23:34.890
<i>Listen, I might be a bit 
tangled in my own web now</i>

23:34.890 --> 23:38.930
<i>But once you unravel the mystery, 
you'll see pure lo-love</i>
